From: Xueqiang Gong <quic_gongx@quicinc.com>
Date: Tue, 18 Mar 2025 16:36:47 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] kernel: export symbol irq_to_desc

fix build issue for CNSS driver

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Xueqiang Gong <quic_gongx@quicinc.com>
---
 kernel/irq/irqdesc.c | 2 --
 1 file changed, 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/kernel/irq/irqdesc.c b/kernel/irq/irqdesc.c
index 46094f0c9fcd..2049ca0bdcdb 100644
--- a/kernel/irq/irqdesc.c
+++ b/kernel/irq/irqdesc.c
@@ -383,9 +383,7 @@ struct irq_desc *irq_to_desc(unsigned int irq)
 {
        return mtree_load(&sparse_irqs, irq);
 }
-#ifdef CONFIG_KVM_BOOK3S_64_HV_MODULE
 EXPORT_SYMBOL_GPL(irq_to_desc);
-#endif
 
 #ifdef CONFIG_SMP
 static void free_masks(struct irq_desc *desc)
